                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "*\tLocated in South Auckland\n* \tSheltered and netted orchard\n*\tIrrigated (SG to provide info)\n*\tUse AKL airport weather\n\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\nMeasurements were\n*\tSap-flow\n*\tFruit growth\n*\tSoil moisture (150–160; 30/20 cm interval); TDR\n*\tLight interception. ",
                  "Name": "ReadMe",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
