              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "* \tThis is a Gold3 orchard\n* \tIrrigated\n* \tSteve to provide update (to July 2024)\n* \tWeather station (Paengaroa) next door - Steve to provide weather data\n*\tLocated in Paengaroa\n\n\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n*\tUsing Hi (as opposed to Lo) measured data for this orchard",
                  "Name": "ReadMe",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Clock, Models",
